          "The dates that matter are the recent ones, because they explain the bottom of the board. OP-15 released February 28, 2026, OP-16 on May 30, 2026, and OP-17 on August 22, 2026, each at a Japanese list price of ¥220 or ¥240 a pack, which is ¥5,280 or ¥5,760 a box. Those are Japanese retail prices at release; our shelf prices sit above them because a shelf price carries sourcing, shipping, and allocation the list price does not. EB-05 Heroines Edition vol.2, the next Extra Booster, released October 31, 2026, and its English case is already on our shelf; the Japanese box is not listed yet, and this page will add it when it is. For OP-18, Bandai's official Japanese product page prints November 21, 2026, at ¥240 a pack, and the official English page prints November 20, 2026, at $4.99 a pack.",
